# ── Secrets & credentials — HIGHEST PRIORITY, never commit ──────────────────
# Any .env with any prefix/suffix/extension (incl. backups), keys, certs, tokens.
.env
.env*
*.env
*.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.crt
*.cer
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.kdbx
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
secrets/
.aws/
.ssh/
**/credentials/**
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*secret*.json
*.secret
*.secrets

# ── Internal material — never commit ────────────────────────────────────────
INTERNAL.md
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
.claude/
runs/
*.log

